---
import { site } from '../lib/site';
const explore = [
  { href: '/eclipse-2027/', label: 'Eclipse 2027' },
  { href: '/eclipse-2027/where-to-watch/', label: 'Where to watch' },
  { href: '/meteor-showers/', label: 'Meteor showers' },
  { href: '/how-we-make-our-numbers/', label: 'How we make our numbers' },
];
const about = [
  { href: '/about/', label: 'About' },
  { href: '/editorial-policy/', label: 'Editorial policy' },
  { href: '/contact/', label: 'Contact' },
  { href: '/disclosure/', label: 'Affiliate disclosure' },
  { href: '/privacy/', label: 'Privacy policy' },
  { href: '/terms/', label: 'Terms of use' },
];
---
<footer>
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="who">
      <div class="brand">{site.name}</div>
      <p>Is it worth going out? We calculate what each eclipse and meteor shower will look like from where you are, and say plainly whether it's worth the trip.</p>
      <p class="small">Some links on this site may earn us a commission. We mark every one. <a class="link" href="/disclosure/">How we earn</a></p>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Explore"><h2>Explore</h2>{explore.map((l) => <a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a>)}</nav>
    <nav aria-label="About and legal"><h2>About</h2>{about.map((l) => <a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a>)}</nav>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap legal">© {new Date().getFullYear()} {site.name}. Eclipse and sky data are calculated by us from open sources, credited on each page.</div>
</footer>

<style>
  footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--footer); margin-top: 48px; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px 48px; padding-top: 44px; padding-bottom: 28px; }
  .brand { font-family: var(--font-head); font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--heading); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .who p { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 0.8em; max-width: 44ch; }
  nav { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  nav h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 0 0 6px; }
  nav a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 40px; color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; }
  nav a:hover { color: var(--heading); text-decoration: underline; }
  .legal { padding-bottom: 36px; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--muted); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
